          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 78058,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari pelajari konsep baru yang menjelaskan cara variabel melacak hal-hal seperti menambahkan atau mengurangi dolar dari dompet.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: darkBlue;&#xA;    /* Green */&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Wallet: &lt;strong&gt;$&lt;span id=&quot;amount&quot;&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Add $1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;remove()&quot;&gt;Remove $1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let wallet = 15;&#xA;   let amountCounter = document.getElementById('amount');&#xA;   &#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    wallet += 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = wallet;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   function remove() {&#xA;    wallet -= 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = wallet;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Assigning a value",
            "id": 78057,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat membuat variabel, kita <strong>menetapkan</strong> sebuah nilai ke variabel tersebut, seperti menetapkan <code>3</code> ke <code>wallet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat membuat variabel, kita <strong>menetapkan</strong> nilai kepadanya. Berikan nilai pada <code>wallet</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Self-assigning a value",
            "id": 78056,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Self-assignment</strong> adalah saat kita menetapkan sebuah variabel ke nilainya sendiri. Misalnya, kita dapat menetapkan <code>wallet</code> ke nilainya, yaitu <code>3</code>, dengan <code>wallet = wallet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>wallet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>wallet</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Self-assignment</strong> menetapkan variabel ke nilainya sendiri. Buat baris kedua agar <code>wallet</code> mempertahankan nilainya dan kode menampilkan <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"wallet\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"wallet\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>wallet</code>, dan terakhir <code>wallet</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 78055,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karena kita dapat menetapkan variabel ke dirinya sendiri, kita dapat menambah atau mengurangi variabel yang diatur ke angka. Coba tambahkan <code>wallet</code> dengan <code>wallet = wallet + 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3 + 1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>wallet + 1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Self-assignment memungkinkan kita mengubah angka. Tambahkan satu ke <code>wallet</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"wallet - 1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"wallet + 3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>wallet + 1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Why self-assigning matters",
            "id": 78053,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel yang ditetapkan ke dirinya sendiri memungkinkan kita melacak data yang berubah seiring waktu. Misalnya, pengguna bisa menambahkan <code>2</code> dolar ke dompet, lalu mengurangi <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2</code>, diikuti oleh <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Self-assignment membantu melacak nilai yang berubah. Mulai dari <code>3</code>, tambahkan <code>2</code>, lalu kurangi <code>1</code>, agar kode menampilkan <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>, diikuti oleh <code>-</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Self-assigning strings",
            "id": 78054,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel yang diatur ke string bekerja dengan cara yang sama. Coba atur <code>name</code> ke <code>name + \" John\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Account name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Elton&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(name)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Account name:  Elton John\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Assigning a value",
            "id": 78052,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai apa yang ditetapkan kode ini ke variabel <code>speed</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kondisi berikutnya memeriksa <code>speed == 0</code>. Berdasarkan assignment ini, apa hasil perbandingannya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code> karena <code>speed</code> menyimpan <code>0</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code> karena <code>speed</code> menyimpan namanya sendiri.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Error karena <code>0</code> tidak dapat ditetapkan ke variabel.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>True</code> karena <code>speed</code> menyimpan <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Self-assigning a value",
            "id": 78051,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kode ini tetap menampilkan <code>100</code> setelah assignment kedua?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Assignment kedua menyimpan kembali nilai <code>speed</code> saat ini ke <code>speed</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Menetapkan variabel ke dirinya sendiri mengembalikannya ke nilai pertama.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python mengabaikan setiap assignment yang menggunakan variabel sama di kedua sisi.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assignment kedua menyimpan kembali nilai <code>speed</code> saat ini ke <code>speed</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 78050,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?  </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"101\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>101</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>101</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana baris kedua membuat konsol menampilkan <code>101</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"101\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Baris itu membaca <code>100</code>, menambahkan <code>1</code>, lalu menyimpan <code>101</code> dalam <code>speed</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Baris itu menggabungkan digit <code>100</code> dan <code>1</code>, lalu menyimpan <code>1001</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Baris itu menghitung <code>101</code>, tetapi tetap menyimpan <code>100</code> dalam <code>speed</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Baris itu membaca <code>100</code>, menambahkan <code>1</code>, lalu menyimpan <code>101</code> dalam <code>speed</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Why self-assigning matters",
            "id": 78063,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa menetapkan nilai ke diri sendiri merupakan konsep pemrograman yang begitu kuat?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Karena memungkinkan kita melacak data yang berubah seiring waktu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karena membantu kita membuat perbandingan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karena memungkinkan kita melacak data yang berubah seiring waktu.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Self-assignment sangat berguna karena memungkinkan kita melacak data yang berubah seiring waktu.</p><p>Sebuah game menambahkan <code>points</code> ke <code>score</code> saat ini setelah setiap ronde. Baris mana yang melacak total baru?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>score = score + points</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>score == score + points</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>score = points</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>score = score + points</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Self-assigning strings",
            "id": 78049,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joanne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Rowling&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(name)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Joanne Rowling\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Joanne Rowling</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Rowling Joanne</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Joanne Rowling</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kode ini menampilkan <code>Joanne Rowling</code>, bukan <code>Rowling Joanne</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joanne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Rowling&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(name)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Joanne Rowling\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nama saat ini berada di sebelah kiri <code>+</code>, sehingga teks baru ditambahkan setelahnya.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Penetapan mengganti nama lama sebelum menggabungkan kedua string.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Self-assignment otomatis memindahkan teks baru ke akhir, terlepas dari urutan operand.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nama saat ini berada di sebelah kiri <code>+</code>, sehingga teks baru ditambahkan setelahnya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
